SUMMARY:Coontree/Perry Cove/Bennet Gap
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nCoontree/Perry Cove/Bennet Gap\nDi
 stance: 7 miles +/-\nElevation gain: 1\,700'\nSpeed: 2-2.5mph average\n\nR
 ight now there are a lot of wild flowers blooming in the forest. I did thi
 s hike a couple of weeks ago and ran into violets\, foamflowers\, geranium
 s\, dwarf iris\, trillium and a few others. Don't know if everything is st
 ill in bloom but only one way to find out.\n\nWe'll meet at the middle par
 king lot at the Pisgah Ranger station at 8:45AM for a 9:00 sharp departure
 .\n\nDogs are welcome. I will have my dog with me.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314613772
 /
